gpu-sim-u2o.6.6.1 -- noise floor of the real measurement path
========================================================================
PREFLIGHT IS BY-PASSED ON PURPOSE: SafeHarness.preflight_check()
currently executes on the real GPU (PI ruling on 6.1.1), so calling
it here would add a second, unaccounted GPU execution to a
measurement experiment. compile_kernel() and run_kernel() are called
directly instead. Kernel is a FIXED hand-written reference kernel:
no generated or untrusted code, no dependency on the fake path.
No sudo, no clock locking, no persistence-mode change; nvidia-smi is
used only for read-only telemetry queries.
